Merry Christmas!  Happy Christmahannukwanzaka! (American joke there)
Happy Holidays!

Regardless of your celebratory tendencies (I'm an atheist myself,
but I still think of it as Christmas), I hope you will all be happy
to know that after about seven months of deliberation, the BPFK
gadri proposal has finally been completed.

I've written a tutorial on the new gadri setup:

http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-index.php?page=How+to+use+xorlo

Feel free to go to the main proposal page as well:

http://www.lojban.org/tiki/tiki-index.php?page=BPFK+Section%3A+gadri

But I warn you that it's a mite technical.

I hope you all enjoy/appreciate it.

